<mxCell id="d_dto" value="&lt;b&gt;DeliveryMapper · DTOs · config&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr style='margin:2px 0'&gt;&lt;div style='text-align:left;font-size:9px'&gt;DeliveryMapper: toResponse&lt;br&gt;UpdateDeliveryStatusRequest · CompleteDeliveryRequest · DeliveryResponse&lt;br&gt;DeliveryCodeProperties (máx. tentativas, chave HMAC) · InvalidDeliveryCodeException&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=2;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1010" y="825" width="740" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p_pc" value="&lt;span style='font-size:9px;color:#555555'&gt;«@RestController»&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;PaymentController&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr style='margin:2px 0'&gt;&lt;div style='text-align:left;font-size:9px'&gt;/api/v1/payments&lt;br&gt;POST {paymentId}/confirm — sem @PreAuthorize de propósito: flag app.payments.mock-confirmation, papel (CUSTOMER dono / OPS / ADMIN) e posse verificados em PaymentService.confirm (404 se flag off)&lt;br&gt;POST {paymentId}/refunds · POST refunds/{refundId}/approve · POST refunds/{refundId}/reject — @PreAuthorize FINANCE, ADMIN&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=2;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1860" y="120" width="740" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p_svc" value="&lt;span style='font-size:9px;color:#555555'&gt;«@Service»&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;PaymentService&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr style='margin:2px 0'&gt;&lt;div style='text-align:left;font-size:9px'&gt;confirm(paymentId, request) — mock; transita encomenda para PAYMENT_CONFIRMED (lê OrderRepository)&lt;br&gt;requestRefund(paymentId, RefundRequest) — lock FOR UPDATE do pagamento; Σ reembolsos não rejeitados ≤ amount (422);&lt;br&gt;    chave reutilizada → mesmo Refund; chave de outro pagamento → 409 idempotency_conflict&lt;br&gt;requestRemainingRefund(...) — reembolsa o restante (usado na rejeição do vendedor / cancelamento)&lt;br&gt;approveRefund(refundId) — lock do pagamento → PARTIALLY_/FULLY_REFUNDED; cobertura total: encomenda REFUNDED&lt;br&gt;    (CANCELLED mantém-se), PIN limpo, DeliveryRetirementService + OrderStockService.release antes da recolha&lt;br&gt;rejectRefund(refundId)&lt;br&gt;Auditoria: PAYMENT_CONFIRMED, REFUND_* via AuditLogService&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=2;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1860" y="265" width="740" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p_repo" value="&lt;span style='font-size:9px;color:#555555'&gt;«JpaRepository»&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;PaymentRepository · RefundRepository&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr style='margin:2px 0'&gt;&lt;div style='text-align:left;font-size:9px'&gt;PaymentRepository: @Lock(PESSIMISTIC_WRITE) findByTenantIdAndIdForUpdate · findByTenantIdAndOrderIdForUpdate&lt;br&gt;    findByTenantIdAndOrderId · findByTenantIdAndIdempotencyKey (uq_payments_tenant_idempotency) · findByTenantIdAndStatusIn&lt;br&gt;RefundRepository: findByTenantIdAndIdempotencyKey (uq_refunds_tenant_idempotency, V040) · findByTenantIdAndPaymentId&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=2;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1860" y="495" width="740" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p_ent" value="&lt;span style='font-size:9px;color:#555555'&gt;«@Entity payments»&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Payment&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr style='margin:2px 0'&gt;&lt;div style='text-align:left;font-size:9px'&gt;id, tenantId, orderId&lt;br&gt;amount, provider, idempotencyKey&lt;br&gt;status: PaymentStatus&lt;br&gt;confirmedAt · @Version&lt;br&gt;markFullyRefunded()&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=2;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1860" y="645" width="240" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p_ref" value="&lt;span style='font-size:9px;color:#555555'&gt;«@Entity refunds»&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Refund&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr style='margin:2px 0'&gt;&lt;div style='text-align:left;font-size:9px'&gt;id, tenantId, paymentId, orderId&lt;br&gt;amount, reason&lt;br&gt;status: RefundStatus&lt;br&gt;idempotencyKey · @Version&lt;br&gt;approve()&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=2;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2110" y="645" width="230" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p_enum" value="&lt;span style='font-size:9px;color:#555555'&gt;«enumeration»&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;enums&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr style='margin:2px 0'&gt;&lt;div style='text-align:left;font-size:9px'&gt;PaymentStatus: INITIATED · PENDING_CONFIRMATION&lt;br&gt;CONFIRMED · FAILED · CANCELLED · REFUND_PENDING&lt;br&gt;PARTIALLY_REFUNDED · REFUNDED · FULLY_REFUNDED&lt;br&gt;(CAPTURED = CONFIRMED, PARTIALLY_, FULLY_)&lt;br&gt;RefundStatus: REQUESTED · APPROVED&lt;br&gt;REJECTED · REFUNDED&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=2;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2350" y="645" width="250" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
