<mxCell id="p1_c32" value="&lt;b&gt;Legenda&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='color:#d79b00'&gt;■&lt;/span&gt; controller &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style='color:#6c8ebf'&gt;■&lt;/span&gt; service &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style='color:#9673a6'&gt;■&lt;/span&gt; guard / serviço partilhado entre módulos &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style='color:#82b366'&gt;■&lt;/span&gt; repository &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style='color:#d6b656'&gt;■&lt;/span&gt; entity / enum &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style='color:#666666'&gt;■&lt;/span&gt; dto / mapper / config&lt;br&gt;──▷ usa (mesmo módulo) &amp;nbsp; - - ▷ implementa &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style='color:#b85450'&gt;- - ▷ chamada a outro módulo (repositório/entidade/serviço) — ciclo ADR-0002&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;Regra: repositórios são Spring Data JPA simples; filtro por tenant (findByTenantIdAnd…) e regras de papel/estado vivem no service." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="150" y="1010" width="1200" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
