<mxCell id="lk0" value="&lt;b style='font-size:11px'&gt;① payments&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='font-size:9px;color:#555555'&gt;[SELECT … FOR UPDATE]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='font-size:10px'&gt;PaymentRepository.findByTenantIdAndOrderIdForUpdate / findByTenantIdAndIdForUpdate (@Lock PESSIMISTIC_WRITE)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1300" y="460" width="470" height="75" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="lk1" value="&lt;b style='font-size:11px'&gt;② orders&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='font-size:9px;color:#555555'&gt;[leitura + @Version]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='font-size:10px'&gt;OrderRepository.findByTenantIdAndId — transição de estado; conflito → 409 concurrent_modification&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=11;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1300" y="555" width="470" height="75" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p2_c28" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#333333;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="lk0" target="lk1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="lk2" value="&lt;b style='font-size:11px'&gt;③ deliveries / dispatch_jobs&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='font-size:9px;color:#555555'&gt;[@Version]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='font-size:10px'&gt;DeliveryRetirementService (propagation MANDATORY) → Delivery CANCELLED + DispatchJob ativo CANCELLED&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=11;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1300" y="650" width="470" height="75" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p2_c29" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#333333;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="lk1" target="lk2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="lk3" value="&lt;b style='font-size:11px'&gt;④ inventory_items&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='font-size:9px;color:#555555'&gt;[SELECT … FOR UPDATE]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='font-size:10px'&gt;InventoryItemRepository.lockByTenantIdAndSkuId — OrderStockService.release/commit (idempotente via stock_status)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=11;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1300" y="745" width="470" height="75" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p2_c30" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#333333;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="lk2" target="lk3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p2_c31" value="&lt;b&gt;Regra de ordem de locks&lt;/b&gt; (OrderService.rejectByVendor, SalesService.lockPayment → cancel / refund / override, PaymentService.requestRefund / approveRefund):&lt;br&gt;pagamento → encomenda → entrega/dispatch → inventário, tudo na &lt;b&gt;mesma transação&lt;/b&gt;; quem perde a corrida vê o estado já commitado (repetição idempotente).&lt;br&gt;Encomenda sem pagamento (pré-pagamento): nada a bloquear, caminho simples." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1300" y="850" width="470" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="ck0" value="&lt;b style='font-size:12px'&gt;Checkout&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='font-size:9px;color:#555555'&gt;[OrderService.checkout — TransactionTemplate]&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=11;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1800" y="460" width="460" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="ck1" value="&lt;div style='text-align:left;font-size:10px'&gt;1. findByTenantIdAndCheckoutIdempotencyKey → existe? replay&lt;br&gt;2. CartRepository.lockByTenantIdAndId (carts FOR UPDATE) — serializa duplo clique&lt;br&gt;3. re-lookup da chave (pode ter commitado enquanto esperava)&lt;br&gt;4. revalida SKU/produto/preço → PriceChangedException 409 + reprice&lt;br&gt;5. PricingService.quote (morada) · reserva stock por skuId ordenado (FOR UPDATE)&lt;br&gt;6. save Order + Payment(mesma chave) + Delivery(PIN HMAC); cart CHECKED_OUT&lt;br&gt;7. DataIntegrityViolation (uq_orders_tenant_checkout_key) → replay em nova tx readOnly&lt;br&gt;replay só p/ mesmo cliente, carrinho e morada; senão 409 idempotency_key_reused&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;align=left;spacingLeft=6;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1800" y="500" width="460" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="rf0" value="&lt;b style='font-size:12px'&gt;Idempotência de reembolsos&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1800" y="680" width="460" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="rf1" value="&lt;div style='text-align:left;font-size:10px'&gt;• RefundRequest.idempotencyKey (corpo) · Sales: header Idempotency-Key (omisso → sales-refund-&amp;lt;uuid&amp;gt;)&lt;br&gt;• rejeição do vendedor: chave seller-reject-&amp;lt;orderId&amp;gt; (legado vendor-rejection-&amp;lt;orderId&amp;gt;)&lt;br&gt;• UNIQUE (tenant_id, idempotency_key) em refunds (V040) e payments&lt;br&gt;• chave repetida → mesmo Refund · chave de outro pagamento/encomenda → 409 idempotency_conflict&lt;br&gt;• Σ reembolsos não rejeitados ≤ payment.amount → senão 422 (lock do pagamento serializa)&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;spacingLeft=6;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1800" y="710" width="460" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p2_c32" value="&lt;b&gt;Outros&lt;/b&gt;: PIN de entrega — tentativas falhadas commitadas (noRollbackFor), bloqueio → 423; unicidade de dispatch ativo por entrega e de entrega ativa por estafeta (índices parciais V035); DeliveryRetirementService exige tx do chamador (MANDATORY)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1800" y="840" width="460" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="pD" value="&lt;b&gt;D · Contrato de erro — RFC 9457&lt;/b&gt; (docs/api/ERROR-CONTRACT.md)" style="swimlane;startSize=26;html=1;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;rounded=0;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;fillColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1010" width="2260" height="210" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p2_c33" value="&lt;div style='text-align:left;font-size:10px'&gt;&lt;b&gt;Origem → status / code&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;BusinessException(code, status) → status próprio (ex.: 403 tenant_required, vendor_scope_unresolved; 409 idempotency_key_reused; 429 rate_limited)&lt;br&gt;NotFoundException → 404 · MethodArgumentNotValid / binding → 400 validation_failed (+ fieldErrors) · malformed_request · invalid_parameter · missing_parameter&lt;br&gt;AccessDeniedException (@PreAuthorize) → 403 forbidden · OptimisticLockingFailureException (@Version) → 409 concurrent_modification&lt;br&gt;DataIntegrityViolationException → 409 conflict · Exception → 500 internal_error (sem detalhe interno)&lt;br&gt;Filtros (antes do MVC): ProblemDetailSecurityHandlers 401/403 · TenantRequestFilter usa ApiProblems.create&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=11;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1050" width="1100" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p2_c34" value="&lt;div style='text-align:left;font-family:monospace;font-size:10px'&gt;HTTP/1.1 409 · Content-Type: application/problem+json&lt;br&gt;{&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&quot;type&quot;: &quot;about:blank&quot;, &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Conflict&quot;, &quot;status&quot;: 409,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&quot;detail&quot;: &quot;…&quot;, &quot;instance&quot;: &quot;/api/v1/checkout&quot;  &lt;i&gt;(só path, sem query)&lt;/i&gt;,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&quot;code&quot;: &quot;idempotency_key_reused&quot;, &quot;correlationId&quot;: &quot;…&quot;, &quot;traceId&quot;: &quot;…&quot;,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&quot;details&quot;: {…}?,  &lt;i&gt;legado:&lt;/i&gt; &quot;message&quot;, &quot;timestamp&quot;, &quot;fieldErrors&quot;: []&lt;br&gt;}&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b85450;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1170" y="1050" width="1090" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
</mxfile>
